Button Pressed in PlayerHomeDialog
    Events
        Dialog - A dialog button is clicked for PlayerHomeDialog
    Conditions
    Actions
        -------- ================================= --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Clicked dialog button) Equal to PlayerHomeDialogBTN1
            Then - Actions
                -------- ================================= --------
                Cinematic - Disable user control for (All players).
                -------- =========================== --------
                -------- DEFAULT CAMERA --------
                -------- =========================== --------
                -------- Check if the faction units are enemy with player --------
                Set VariableSet PlayerHomeTempPoint = (Position of PlayerHomeTravelersJournal)
                Custom script:   set bj_wantDestroyGroup = true
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units within 900.00 of PlayerHomeTempPoint.) and do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                ((Picked unit) belongs to an ally of Player 1 (Red).) Equal to True
                            Then - Actions
                                Set VariableSet PlayerHomeAllyFound = True
                            Else - Actions
                                Set VariableSet PlayerHomeAllyFound = False
                Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_PlayerHomeTempPoint)
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        PlayerHomeAllyFound Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- ================================= --------
                        -------- Set current location as home --------
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: |cFFFFCC00Traveler'...
                        Set VariableSet PlayerHomeLocation = (Position of PlayerHomeTravelersJournal)
                        Set VariableSet PlayerHomeTravelersJournalSel = PlayerHomeTravelersJournal
                        -------- Update quest log (Traveler's Journal) --------
                        Trigger - Run Player Home Update QLog <gen> (checking conditions)
                        -------- Effects --------
                        Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the origin of PlayerHomeUnit using Abilities\Spells\Human\MassTeleport\MassTeleportTo.mdl
                        Special Effect - Destroy (Last created special effect)
                        Sound - Play PlayerHomeSet <gen> at 100.00% volume, attached to PlayerHomeTravelersJournal
                        -------- Animations of Travelers Journals --------
                        Custom script:   set bj_wantDestroyGroup = true
                        Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units in (Playable map area)) and do (Actions)
                            Loop - Actions
                                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                                    If - Conditions
                                        (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Traveler's Journal 2
                                        (Picked unit) Not equal to PlayerHomeTravelersJournal
                                    Then - Actions
                                        Animation - Play (Picked unit)'s stand animation
                                    Else - Actions
                        -------- Animations of selected as home Journall --------
                        Animation - Play PlayerHomeTravelersJournal's stand second animation
                        -------- =========================== --------
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (PlayerHomeUnit has an item of type Traveler's Journal) Equal to False
                            Then - Actions
                                Hero - Create Traveler's Journal and give it to PlayerHomeUnit
                                Sound - Play ItemReceived <gen>
                            Else - Actions
                    Else - Actions
                        Game - Display to (All players) the text: |cFFFFCC00Traveler'...
                        Sound - Play Error <gen>
                -------- ======== CINEMATIC ENDS ======== --------
                Camera - Apply TravelersJournalCamera <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
                Camera - Apply TravelersJournalCamera2 <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 3.00 seconds
                Camera - Pan camera for Player 1 (Red) to (Position of PlayerHomeTravelersJournal) over 0.00 seconds
                Wait 3.00 seconds
                Trigger - Run Cinematic OFF <gen> (checking conditions)
                Countdown Timer - Start DialogOverTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 1.00 seconds
                Trigger - Run Hint 6 Travelers Journal 2 <gen> (checking conditions)
                Skip remaining actions
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
